<title>FRANCE: Canal Plus holdings post-merger.</title>
<headline>Canal Plus holdings post-merger.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>French television group Canal Plus told analysts on Monday its shareholder structure following the tie-up with Nethold announced on Friday would be as follows.</p>
<p>			after (pct)   before (pvt)</p>
<p>    Havas		   17.3		23.6</p>
<p>    Generale des Eaux   15.4		20.4</p>
<p>    Societe Generale	3.6		5.0</p>
<p>    Richemont		15.0		N/A</p>
<p>    MIH			 4.9		N/A</p>
<p>    Floating		43.7		38.2</p>
<p>Note - The group also told analysts it would maintain its dividend after the merger. Its net dividend in 1995 was 20 francs.</p>
</text>
